    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by Land Acquisition (Amendment)Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the lands described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
